### ClickNode
```typescript
class ClickNode {
  onBang(audioCtx: AudioContext) {
    // Create a short impulse: 1 sample at full amplitude, then silence
    const buf = audioCtx.createBuffer(1, 512, audioCtx.sampleRate);
    const data = buf.getChannelData(0);
    data[0] = 1.0;  // single-sample impulse (or shape a short envelope)

    const src = audioCtx.createBufferSource();
    src.buffer = buf;
    src.connect(audioCtx.destination); // or to DacNode's gain
    src.start();
  }
}
```

The click shape can be improved: a very short (2–5ms) exponential decay sounds better than a raw impulse. This is a tuning decision for Phase 3.

