## Cable Style: Straight Lines (PD style)

Per the design decision in `PLAN.md`: **straight lines only**, not bezier curves.

```javascript
function cablePath(x1, y1, x2, y2) {
  return `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2} ${y2}`;
}
```

Rationale: Pure Data uses straight cables. They are visually cleaner at scale and easier to trace in complex patches. Max/MSP's bezier curves are harder to follow visually.

